+            "Oct 15 15:27:21 photonvision kernel: [  233.792729] usb 1-2-port1: attempt power cycle",
+            "Oct 15 15:27:31 photonvision kernel: [  244.368770] usb 1-2-port1: unable to enumerate USB device",
